window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>A betrayed witch. A broken secret. A malevolent destiny.</b></p> <p>Paladin Agent Alice Skye is desperate to get back in the field, and gets her chance, but not as she expected. Thrust into a gruesome homicide, Alice faces a case that tests the limits of her magical knowledge, and threatens to destroy not only her, but everyone she loves.<br> <br> Still grieving her recent loss, Alice is struggling to rebuild her life when an unexpected letter from Dread’s estate uncovers a secret that should have stayed buried. But time is running out. In the shadows, powerful enemies await, determined to stop the prophecy that has haunted her since birth.<br> <br> To survive, Alice must confront her greatest challenge yet: the Knights, a guild of assassins bound by a ruthless creed.<br> <br> Protect the innocent. Slay the corrupt. Defend the realm.<br> <br> And unfortunately for Alice, she’s their number one target.<br> <br> ---<br> <br> Knight's War is the fifth instalment of the dark &amp; twisted urban fantasy series containing explicit content, graphic violence, profanity, and topics that may be sensitive to some listeners. Full details can be found listed inside the book.<br> <br> <i>Disclaimer: This novel is written in British English including spelling and grammar.</i></p>"; 
